HOW TO READ THIS
  Q1  worstLinRes <= ~1e-9      -> the inner solves are NOT the precision limit,
                                   and audit.md section 1's clearing of TD-003 stands.
  Q2  fuel bal falling with     -> the 4.33% is a STOPPING-CRITERION artefact; the
      march length                 gate should require steadiness.
      fuel bal plateauing       -> a REAL conservation defect; no march length fixes
                                   it and TD-004 must repair the discretisation.
  Q3  e/f staying at ~1.0000    -> the two balances are ONE measurement (F12), and
                                   the gate must not count them as two.
